{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1003_p", "source_sha256": "92cc124de6f45e094e1aa1bfd17c7db38571c1c5d9d2f4fd32fb53b40f087387", "ja": "おかえり。屋台巡りはどうだった？", "zh": "欢迎回来。逛小吃摊感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "9f1c51b6495be40d10816ee2abe37011b8dd5d51dda705d5cec44617fa637a55", "ja": "ええっ！？　なんでわかったん！？\n{$P$}さん……まさか見てた？", "zh": "诶！？你怎么知道的！？\n{$P$}先生……难道你看到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4b24477547bcbb1cead33e426745869e921ff676eaf39957f4e88fc7eed73684", "ja": "いや見てないけど。\n来るときも奈緒、ずっとお店の方見てたしな。", "zh": "没看啊。\n不过来的时候，奈绪你一直盯着店里看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "dd39cea5fee0168dd765c90a55090c6af626fd57d95d1324ac9339a26e9dde38", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん！\n私のことようわかってくれてますね～♪", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生！真了解我呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "94f88bca565cb01a3931c732befe757c971d707781ced38884e8fd125e905a61", "ja": "せっかく中華街に来たんですから、\n食べ歩きせなって……あ、ちゃんとセーブしましたよ！", "zh": "难得都来到中华街了，当然得边走边吃……啊，我有好好存档哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4ce854ed337840e2f4e35ca7838ab6587fef7c33784b6db50031a823cb0ed6c4", "ja": "まあ確かに、美味しそうなお店が多いからな。\n気持ちはわかるよ。", "zh": "倒也是，毕竟看起来很好吃的店挺多的嘛。\n我懂你的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "95ce342073901afae9183eddadd409454ecae20bece1c6ab769018bb561db5df", "ja": "でしょ？　しかも、このチャイナ服で歩いてると、\nみんなフレンドリーに話しかけてくれるんですよ。", "zh": "对吧？而且穿着这身旗袍走在街上，大家都会很友好地主动来搭话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "ed099b802dd9c6a221bca42b1ce0f8cb879bcc91882bfeb619d8d53ea71be481", "ja": "さっきなんて、「看板娘になって！」って、スカウト\nされましたもん。お給料も良くて、点心食べ放題付き！", "zh": "刚才甚至有人对我说“来当招牌女郎吧！”，想把我挖走呢。工资也不错，还附赠点心吃到饱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c4c6d2896e944c2914effb55571618fadaec30d773659e0b0be4c0f57752273f", "ja": "まさかそれ、引き受けたのか？\n点心につられて……。", "zh": "你该不会答应了吧？\n被点心给诱惑了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
