{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cf6560c12ce8c86135c310fde8f35a620618947e5781ecd22b776e71c6a5ace6", "ja": "ああ、うん……よかった。", "zh": "啊，嗯……那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "c52ed691998cbf54c0d10400b60d5d5720d9093af5b43e7baffa92f179a7b4aa", "ja": "私のこと、なんやと思ってるんですか……。\nまあ、美味しそうやったんはホンマですけど。", "zh": "你把我当成什么人了啊……\n不过，刚才那个看起来确实很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "2aeec8b0692832173b1fb7ed9427d4dc97428e2c1923c5805d378abac9b751d9", "ja": "そや！　撮影終わったら{$P$}さんも\n食べ歩きしません？　私あの店行きたい～♪", "zh": "对了！拍摄结束后，要不要和{$P$}先生一起去边走边吃？我想去那家店～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3ef8f84d4986c99c4b684b6ddbee456d440d626142a2403445d92315eaf0f099", "ja": "えっ、まあいいけど……。\n今行ってきたところなのにか？", "zh": "诶，嗯，倒也可以……。\n明明才刚去过不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0193_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "498608b2ddc5e85d1aab76db2f72742fdafa87f838d805f6d0bcca3b9e827ead", "ja": "一緒なんがいいんやん～♪\nよっしゃ、お腹空かせるために、撮影頑張りますよ～！", "zh": "一起才好嘛～♪\n好嘞，为了让肚子空下来，我会努力拍摄的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
